# Workflow — Spec-first · Small PR · Test-gated

Canonical copy: [`AGENTS.md`](mdc:AGENTS.md). Templates: [`documents/ai/templates/`](mdc:documents/ai/templates/).

## Pipeline

```text
Problem → Spec/contract → Failing tests (if behavior) → Small PR → Gate → Review → Merge
```

## Contract before code

No production edits until **Problem · Goal · Non-goals · Contract · Acceptance** exist or are restated in the task.

- **Contract change:** spec amendment + tests **before** production.
- **Regression:** reproduction test **before** fix.
- **Audit-only task:** read-only; no production edits.

## One PR · one purpose

```text
Good: PR-3 failing tests only · PR-4 minimal implementation
Bad:  redesign + UI + cleanup + perf in one PR
```

Split when scope exceeds one contract change or one refactor goal.

## Agent scope (required every task)

Restate or confirm:

```text
Position · Mission · Authority (may / must not) · Primary lens · Inputs · Acceptance · Stop conditions
```

Reject (BLOCKED) when:

- ❌ No failing test for behavior change (except docs-only contract)
- ❌ Public contract changes without spec/doc update
- ❌ Scope spans multiple PR purposes
- ❌ Stale/superseded doc used as authority

## Test order

```text
audit → failing test → minimal fix → regression/golden → focused pytest → ruff
```

PR merge: full gate per [`AGENTS.md`](mdc:AGENTS.md).

## Document authority

| Source | Weight |
|---|---|
| CANON spec + ADR | Design authority |
| ACTIVE plan | Tracker only |
| Superseded / deleted docs | Not implementation context |

## Human · Agent · CI

| Actor | Role |
|---|---|
| Human | Contract · scope approval · merge |
| Agent | Scoped audit · tests · implementation · report |
| CI | Full gate |

## Checklists

**Before start**

- ⬜ problem one-liner
- ⬜ non-goals written
- ⬜ invariants listed
- ⬜ authority doc (CANON spec) identified
- ⬜ audit if behavior uncertain

**Before production edit**

- ⬜ contract brief written
- ⬜ failing test when behavior changes
- ⬜ scope = one PR purpose
- ⬜ compatibility checked

**Before PR**

- ⬜ focused gates green
- ⬜ golden/snapshot diffs intentional
- ⬜ docs match code
- ⬜ dead code noted

**Before merge**

- ⬜ single PR purpose
- ⬜ rollback plausible
- ⬜ contract impact in PR body
- ⬜ next PR named

## Position vs persona

Use **Position + scope + acceptance**, not abstract persona fluff.

Domain lenses: [`persona/README.md`](mdc:persona/README.md) — routing hints only, not mandatory dialogue roleplay.
